{
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "_note": "入参必须先 op:set 落地成 data 域的键,方法参数里才看得见(§9.5 #3)。`.xwidget` 不传 → 空串 → 归 0 → 全程不碰缓存。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "cacheIn",
        "value": "${_cache}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "useCache",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(${cacheIn},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "**结构版本号**:pack 的字段集变了就 +1。它管的不是「数据新不新」而是「这份数据的**形状**还认不认」——缓存键只含对象维度、不含包代际,不盖这个戳,升级后首屏就会拿上一版的 pack 去渲新模板:少的字段取空,尺寸串里的 calc 一算 null,**整卡白块且不报错**。\n⚠️ 从 1 起、绝不能用 0(`eq::(空,0)` 恒为 true,旧缓存会被判成匹配)。⚠️ 刻意不用 `manifest.version`:flow 拿不到,且那会过度失效(只改配色也丢全部缓存)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "SCHEMA",
        "value": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "缓存键。⚠️ 凡是影响结果的入参都要进键,且**绝不能用下标**(下标随增删漂移,漂移后会把 A 的数据渲成 B 的,还不报错)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ckey",
        "value": "c.lobsters.new"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "读缓存。`default:{}` 让下面的 ${hit.ts} 在无缓存时安全取空,而不是整条流断掉。",
      "id": "hit",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "${ckey}",
        "default": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hitSchema",
        "value": "${hit.schema}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nowMs",
        "value": "${@time.nowMs}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hitTs",
        "value": "$[parseNumber::(${hit.ts},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "age",
        "value": "$[calc::(${nowMs}-${hitTs})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "两道闸:**结构比对**(pack 形状对不上就当没有缓存 —— 旧形状渲新模板是白块,比等一次网络糟得多)+ hardTTL = 86400s(太旧的数先渲出来再改口,不如老实等一次)。嵌套 if 而不是 and:: —— `and` 不在确认可用的方法集里。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hasHit",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${hitSchema},${SCHEMA}),if::(gt::(${hitTs},0),if::(lt::(${age},86400000),1,0),0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "ttl = 300s(§5.5.3)。纯新鲜度,不掺 useCache —— 掺进去 `_stale` 就算不对了。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "fresh",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(${hitTs},0),if::(lt::(${age},300000),1,0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "「这次先出的是旧货,请后台校新」。**必须进 resultFilter** —— 校新那条路靠它,漏了就是永不校新。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_stale",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${useCache},1),if::(eq::(${hasHit},1),if::(eq::(${fresh},1),0,1),0),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "只有「开了缓存 且 有没超 hardTTL 的货」才跳过网络 —— 连接都不建立。⚠️ **stale 也走这条跳过**(首屏零等待是三态的全部价值);写成「不 fresh 就打」= 退回两态,首屏照样白等。卡片(useCache=0)与冷启一律落进 items 真取数。",
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${useCache},1),if::(eq::(${hasHit},1),0,1),1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "request",
          "id": "resp",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://lobste.rs/newest.json",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_b",
            "value": "1"
          },
          "_note": "⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "list",
            "value": [
              {
                "t": "${resp[0].title}",
                "u": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[0].url},${resp[0].comments_url})]",
                "d": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp[0].url}),0),${resp[0].comments_url},)]",
                "s": "${resp[0].score}",
                "c": "${resp[0].comment_count}",
                "g": "${resp[0].tags[0]}",
                "ts": "${resp[0].created_at}"
              },
              {
                "t": "${resp[1].title}",
                "u": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[1].url},${resp[1].comments_url})]",
                "d": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp[1].url}),0),${resp[1].comments_url},)]",
                "s": "${resp[1].score}",
                "c": "${resp[1].comment_count}",
                "g": "${resp[1].tags[0]}",
                "ts": "${resp[1].created_at}"
              },
              {
                "t": "${resp[2].title}",
                "u": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[2].url},${resp[2].comments_url})]",
                "d": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp[2].url}),0),${resp[2].comments_url},)]",
                "s": "${resp[2].score}",
                "c": "${resp[2].comment_count}",
                "g": "${resp[2].tags[0]}",
                "ts": "${resp[2].created_at}"
              },
              {
                "t": "${resp[3].title}",
                "u": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[3].url},${resp[3].comments_url})]",
                "d": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp[3].url}),0),${resp[3].comments_url},)]",
                "s": "${resp[3].score}",
                "c": "${resp[3].comment_count}",
                "g": "${resp[3].tags[0]}",
                "ts": "${resp[3].created_at}"
              },
              {
                "t": "${resp[4].title}",
                "u": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[4].url},${resp[4].comments_url})]",
                "d": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp[4].url}),0),${resp[4].comments_url},)]",
                "s": "${resp[4].score}",
                "c": "${resp[4].comment_count}",
                "g": "${resp[4].tags[0]}",
                "ts": "${resp[4].created_at}"
              },
              {
                "t": "${resp[5].title}",
                "u": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[5].url},${resp[5].comments_url})]",
                "d": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp[5].url}),0),${resp[5].comments_url},)]",
                "s": "${resp[5].score}",
                "c": "${resp[5].comment_count}",
                "g": "${resp[5].tags[0]}",
                "ts": "${resp[5].created_at}"
              },
              {
                "t": "${resp[6].title}",
                "u": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[6].url},${resp[6].comments_url})]",
                "d": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp[6].url}),0),${resp[6].comments_url},)]",
                "s": "${resp[6].score}",
                "c": "${resp[6].comment_count}",
                "g": "${resp[6].tags[0]}",
                "ts": "${resp[6].created_at}"
              },
              {
                "t": "${resp[7].title}",
                "u": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[7].url},${resp[7].comments_url})]",
                "d": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp[7].url}),0),${resp[7].comments_url},)]",
                "s": "${resp[7].score}",
                "c": "${resp[7].comment_count}",
                "g": "${resp[7].tags[0]}",
                "ts": "${resp[7].created_at}"
              },
              {
                "t": "${resp[8].title}",
                "u": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[8].url},${resp[8].comments_url})]",
                "d": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp[8].url}),0),${resp[8].comments_url},)]",
                "s": "${resp[8].score}",
                "c": "${resp[8].comment_count}",
                "g": "${resp[8].tags[0]}",
                "ts": "${resp[8].created_at}"
              },
              {
                "t": "${resp[9].title}",
                "u": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[9].url},${resp[9].comments_url})]",
                "d": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp[9].url}),0),${resp[9].comments_url},)]",
                "s": "${resp[9].score}",
                "c": "${resp[9].comment_count}",
                "g": "${resp[9].tags[0]}",
                "ts": "${resp[9].created_at}"
              },
              {
                "t": "${resp[10].title}",
                "u": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[10].url},${resp[10].comments_url})]",
                "d": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp[10].url}),0),${resp[10].comments_url},)]",
                "s": "${resp[10].score}",
                "c": "${resp[10].comment_count}",
                "g": "${resp[10].tags[0]}",
                "ts": "${resp[10].created_at}"
              },
              {
                "t": "${resp[11].title}",
                "u": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[11].url},${resp[11].comments_url})]",
                "d": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp[11].url}),0),${resp[11].comments_url},)]",
                "s": "${resp[11].score}",
                "c": "${resp[11].comment_count}",
                "g": "${resp[11].tags[0]}",
                "ts": "${resp[11].created_at}"
              },
              {
                "t": "${resp[12].title}",
                "u": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[12].url},${resp[12].comments_url})]",
                "d": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp[12].url}),0),${resp[12].comments_url},)]",
                "s": "${resp[12].score}",
                "c": "${resp[12].comment_count}",
                "g": "${resp[12].tags[0]}",
                "ts": "${resp[12].created_at}"
              },
              {
                "t": "${resp[13].title}",
                "u": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[13].url},${resp[13].comments_url})]",
                "d": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp[13].url}),0),${resp[13].comments_url},)]",
                "s": "${resp[13].score}",
                "c": "${resp[13].comment_count}",
                "g": "${resp[13].tags[0]}",
                "ts": "${resp[13].created_at}"
              },
              {
                "t": "${resp[14].title}",
                "u": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[14].url},${resp[14].comments_url})]",
                "d": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp[14].url}),0),${resp[14].comments_url},)]",
                "s": "${resp[14].score}",
                "c": "${resp[14].comment_count}",
                "g": "${resp[14].tags[0]}",
                "ts": "${resp[14].created_at}"
              },
              {
                "t": "${resp[15].title}",
                "u": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[15].url},${resp[15].comments_url})]",
                "d": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp[15].url}),0),${resp[15].comments_url},)]",
                "s": "${resp[15].score}",
                "c": "${resp[15].comment_count}",
                "g": "${resp[15].tags[0]}",
                "ts": "${resp[15].created_at}"
              },
              {
                "t": "${resp[16].title}",
                "u": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[16].url},${resp[16].comments_url})]",
                "d": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp[16].url}),0),${resp[16].comments_url},)]",
                "s": "${resp[16].score}",
                "c": "${resp[16].comment_count}",
                "g": "${resp[16].tags[0]}",
                "ts": "${resp[16].created_at}"
              },
              {
                "t": "${resp[17].title}",
                "u": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[17].url},${resp[17].comments_url})]",
                "d": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp[17].url}),0),${resp[17].comments_url},)]",
                "s": "${resp[17].score}",
                "c": "${resp[17].comment_count}",
                "g": "${resp[17].tags[0]}",
                "ts": "${resp[17].created_at}"
              },
              {
                "t": "${resp[18].title}",
                "u": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[18].url},${resp[18].comments_url})]",
                "d": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp[18].url}),0),${resp[18].comments_url},)]",
                "s": "${resp[18].score}",
                "c": "${resp[18].comment_count}",
                "g": "${resp[18].tags[0]}",
                "ts": "${resp[18].created_at}"
              },
              {
                "t": "${resp[19].title}",
                "u": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[19].url},${resp[19].comments_url})]",
                "d": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp[19].url}),0),${resp[19].comments_url},)]",
                "s": "${resp[19].score}",
                "c": "${resp[19].comment_count}",
                "g": "${resp[19].tags[0]}",
                "ts": "${resp[19].created_at}"
              },
              {
                "t": "${resp[20].title}",
                "u": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[20].url},${resp[20].comments_url})]",
                "d": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp[20].url}),0),${resp[20].comments_url},)]",
                "s": "${resp[20].score}",
                "c": "${resp[20].comment_count}",
                "g": "${resp[20].tags[0]}",
                "ts": "${resp[20].created_at}"
              },
              {
                "t": "${resp[21].title}",
                "u": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[21].url},${resp[21].comments_url})]",
                "d": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp[21].url}),0),${resp[21].comments_url},)]",
                "s": "${resp[21].score}",
                "c": "${resp[21].comment_count}",
                "g": "${resp[21].tags[0]}",
                "ts": "${resp[21].created_at}"
              },
              {
                "t": "${resp[22].title}",
                "u": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[22].url},${resp[22].comments_url})]",
                "d": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp[22].url}),0),${resp[22].comments_url},)]",
                "s": "${resp[22].score}",
                "c": "${resp[22].comment_count}",
                "g": "${resp[22].tags[0]}",
                "ts": "${resp[22].created_at}"
              },
              {
                "t": "${resp[23].title}",
                "u": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[23].url},${resp[23].comments_url})]",
                "d": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp[23].url}),0),${resp[23].comments_url},)]",
                "s": "${resp[23].score}",
                "c": "${resp[23].comment_count}",
                "g": "${resp[23].tags[0]}",
                "ts": "${resp[23].created_at}"
              },
              {
                "t": "${resp[24].title}",
                "u": "$[findNotEmpty::(${resp[24].url},${resp[24].comments_url})]",
                "d": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${resp[24].url}),0),${resp[24].comments_url},)]",
                "s": "${resp[24].score}",
                "c": "${resp[24].comment_count}",
                "g": "${resp[24].tags[0]}",
                "ts": "${resp[24].created_at}"
              }
            ]
          },
          "_note": "归一后的行(t 标题 · u 原站 · d 讨论页 · s 热度 · c 评论数 · g 标签 · ga 标签英文名(V2EX)· ts 发帖时刻)。**没有正文字段** —— §3.13 的判据就是 grep 不到。"
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "fetchedMs",
            "value": "${@time.nowMs}"
          },
          "_note": "取数时刻(页面时效锚)。"
        },
        {
          "_note": "写回哨兵:**直接取响应字段,不加任何兜底** —— 取数失败/响应变形时它必空。别拿加工后的显示字段当判据,那些几乎都带兜底,拦不住任何东西。",
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_guard",
            "value": "${resp[0].short_id}"
          }
        },
        {
          "_note": "整份渲染输入打包落盘。⚠️ 键集必须与 resultFilter 完全一致 —— 少一个,命中缓存那趟就少一个字段(而且不报错)。",
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "pack",
            "value": {
              "list": "${list}",
              "fetchedMs": "${fetchedMs}",
              "ts": "${nowMs}",
              "schema": "${SCHEMA}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "_note": "契约 4(§5.5.2):关键字段非空才写回。`_guard` 在取数失败/响应变形时必空 —— 此时什么都不写,盘上的旧货留着继续渲。一次超时把 pack 写成空,就把这页永久钉死在空态上直到下次恰好成功。",
          "op": "if",
          "props": {
            "val": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${_guard}),0),1,0)]"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "action": "data.set",
              "params": {
                "key": "${ckey}",
                "value": "${pack}"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_note": "统一出口:走没走网络都从缓存对象取渲染输入 —— 两条路径只有一份字段映射,不会出现「命中那条少算一个字段」的分叉。",
      "id": "box",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "${ckey}",
        "default": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "list",
        "value": "${box.list}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "fetchedMs",
        "value": "${box.fetchedMs}"
      }
    },
    {
      "action": "resultFilter",
      "params": {
        "keys": [
          "_stale",
          "ckey",
          "list",
          "fetchedMs"
        ]
      },
      "_note": "resultFilter 恒放最后;少透一个键,下游就是空参。⚠️ `_stale`/`ckey` 是校新那条路的入参,别删。"
    }
  ]
}
